{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.UpQuark","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.UpQuark","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.ParticleKnots","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.up_quark_confined","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.up_quark_confined","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/up-quark.lean#L47-L49","doc":"The up quark is color-confined. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.up_quark_positive_orientation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.up_quark_positive_orientation","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/up-quark.lean#L42-L45","doc":"The up quark has positive crossing orientation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.up_quark_is_unknot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.up_quark_is_unknot","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/up-quark.lean#L30-L40","doc":"The up quark is an unknot (same underlying knot as the neutrino,\n`QOU.Archimedean.Neutrino`): zero crossings and trivial Seifert genus.\nThe neutrino's defining invariants are `crossing_number = 0`,\n`genus = 0`; this states the matching values for the up quark. ","signatureChunk":0}]}